<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεῖρα</span></b>  (B), ἡ, a cow
		or other animal <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that has not
				brought forth young</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεῖραν βοῦν . . ῥέξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.522
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶγα στεῖραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					429.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of women, <i>barren</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				11.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				25.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοῖρα ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.468
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στείρῃσι γυναιξί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					459
				</span></i>
			; of women past childbearing, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.127
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεῖρα διάνοια, φύσις,
				ψυχή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.441
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				636
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				478
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not having had offspring, virgin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				670
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>star[imacracute]s</i> 'barren cow,
			heifer', Lat. <i>sterilis.</i>)</div>
